WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.304
Step 1. Open the patient's profile; the update form opens from there.

1.2
00:00:05.304 --> 00:00:10.491
From Patient Home, select the patient's name, then View Profile.

2.1
00:00:10.491 --> 00:00:15.275
Step 2. Open the update form. In General Info, select Edit.

2.2
00:00:15.275 --> 00:00:21.154
Care opens Update Patient Details, with the patient's current details.

3.1
00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:23.408
Step 3. Change the details.

3.2
00:00:23.408 --> 00:00:28.231
The form has two sections, Patient Basics and Additional Details.

3.3
00:00:28.231 --> 00:00:31.848
Change the fields that you want to update.

4.1
00:00:31.848 --> 00:00:33.878
Step 4. Save the changes.

4.2
00:00:33.878 --> 00:00:38.576
Select Update, which is available only after you change something.

4.3
00:00:38.576 --> 00:00:44.557
Care shows Patient Updated Successfully and returns you to the previous page.
